# The sound switches in level 1, written by hand: through the opening's lines, then Alt+S (the effects off), a
# walk with Erik's jump and Baleog's sword unheard, Alt+M (the music off), Alt+S held for three steps (on, off,
# on), and Alt+M again (the music on).
slot 0
steps 480
key 3 0x8000
key 10 0x8000
key 20 0x8000
held 40 0x38
held 40 0x1f
key 50-70 0x0100
key 60 0x8000
key 72 0x0010
key 75 0x8000
held 90 0x38
held 90 0x32
held 110-112 0x38
held 110-112 0x1f
key 120 0x8000
held 150 0x38
held 150 0x32
key 200-260 0x0200
key 270 0x0010
key 280-320 0x0100
